        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "この家具は尻の部分に滑り止めがついている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "鍋の尻が焦げ付いてしまった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "葉の尻に小さな虫が隠れていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "last place",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "マラソンで彼はまた尻になってしまった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "クラスでいつも成績が尻だった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "チームはリーグ戦で尻に沈んでしまった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "gloss": "consequence",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "自分のしたことの尻を拭くのは自分だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "その場の勢いで決めてしまい、後でその尻を押し付けられた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "計画性のない行動は、必ず尻に響く。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
